The licensed Fabrics-Sim robot USD and textures are not packaged here. The prepared
robot is hosted separately on the internal isaac-dev server with its original
licensing and access restrictions; public redistribution is not implied.

The optional Kit kitchen backdrop references NVIDIA's public Isaac Sim asset
library, respecting the configured ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT:
Isaac/Environments/replicator_kitchen/kitchen_l_island.usda
The sample composes NVIDIA SimReady residential appliances and kitchen props.
No downloaded NVIDIA USD, MDL or texture files are redistributed here.
